### User Profile API Tests (Session-Based Authentication)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Login First to Establish Session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test-terminal-verify@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123!"
}

### 2. Get Profile - Valid Session
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/profile

### 3. Check Session Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session

### 4. Refresh Session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session/refresh
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 5. Get Profile After Session Refresh
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/profile

### 6. Logout to End Session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 7. Try to Get Profile After Logout (Should be Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/profile

### 8. Check Session Status After Logout (Should be Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session

### 9. Login with Remember Me for Extended Session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test-terminal-verify@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123!",
  "rememberMe": true
}

### 10. Get Profile with Extended Session
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/profile

### 11. Check Extended Session Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session

### 12. Logout Extended Session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 13. Verify Profile Access is Denied After Extended Session Logout
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/profile